IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-S15.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat"
    ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 IN-TEXT PIC X(8).
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-TEXT PIC X(8).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2).
01 PACK-ODD PIC S9(5) COMP-3.
01 PACK-EVEN PIC S9(6) COMP-3.
01 DISP-ODD PIC S9(5) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
01 DISP-EVEN PIC S9(6) SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE 12345 TO PACK-ODD
    MOVE 123456 TO PACK-EVEN
    MOVE PACK-ODD TO DISP-ODD
    MOVE PACK-EVEN TO DISP-EVEN
    DISPLAY DISP-ODD DISP-EVEN
    STOP RUN.
